join mega_interviewer center

mega_interviewer: Final question - What would you do to crush the competition?

[signal arg="timer_start"]

- Use any strategy necessary to dominate the market
	set {interview_score} += 30
	set {interview_health} += 30
	[signal arg="timer_end"]
	mega_interviewer: Ruthless! Perfect. That's the MegaCorp spirit we need.
	[signal arg="correct_choice"]

- Work smarter and innovate better than competitors
	set {interview_score} += 15
	set {interview_health} += 15
	[signal arg="timer_end"]
	mega_interviewer: Good strategy, but lacks the killer instinct.
	[signal arg="correct_choice"]

- Focus on our strengths and improve quality
	set {interview_score} += 5
	set {interview_health} += 5
	[signal arg="timer_end"]
	mega_interviewer: Safe approach, but won't help us dominate markets.
	[signal arg="correct_choice"]

- Compete fairly and ethically
	set {interview_score} -= 10
	set {interview_health} -= 10
	[signal arg="timer_end"]
	mega_interviewer: Ethics are luxury we can't afford in cutthroat business.
	[signal arg="wrong_choice"]

[wait time="1.0"]
[signal arg="update_ui"]

# Final interview conclusion
[wait time="1.0"]

mega_interviewer: Assessment complete. Let me evaluate your performance.

if {interview_score} >= 50:
	mega_interviewer: Exceptional! You have the ruthlessness we need. Welcome to the executive track at MegaCorp!
elif {interview_score} >= 30:
	mega_interviewer: Adequate corporate material. You'll start in middle management.
elif {interview_score} >= 15:
	mega_interviewer: Barely acceptable. Entry level position, probation period.
else:
	mega_interviewer: Pathetic. Security will escort you out.

set {day5_completed} = true
set {day5_score} = {interview_score}

leave mega_interviewer
